refused: d278_op_above_follows.cy:7:4, line 7 column 4
 7 | op above [$a: money, $b: money] returns bool:
   |    ^^^^^
 what: `above` follows from `==` and `below`, so a type doesn't write it
 why:  `!=`, `above`, `at_least` and `at_most` follow from `==` and `below`, so they can never disagree, and aren't written (D237, D278)
